{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 156790, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 104936, "uid": 81618, "type": 4, "title": "DC韩语速成-2、子音（辅音）", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1653214323, "updated_at": 1653442340, "updated_uid": 81618, "comment_at": 1653412946, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 6, "status": 1, "summary": "辅音是指发音时气流通过口腔受阻而发出的音，根据声带是否振动又分为浊辅音和清辅音。普通话的汉语拼音里有四个声母是浊辅音，分别是双唇鼻音m、鼻音n，边音l和浊擦音r。韩语中称辅音为子音（자음），现在有19", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/81618/2022/4/22/642183.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/81618/2022/4/23/917491.PNG", "model_ids": "158933", "like_count": 2, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 6294, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 156790, "content": "<div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br></span></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">辅音是指发音时气流通过口腔受阻而发出的音，根据声带是否振动又分为浊辅音和清辅音。普通话的汉语拼音里有四个声母是浊辅音，分别是双唇鼻音m、鼻音n，边音l和浊擦音r。</span></span><div>韩语中称辅音为子音（<span style=\"text-align: left;\">자음</span>），现在有19个，它们是“<span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㄱ、</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㄷ、ㅂ、</span>ㅅ、<span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㅈ；</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㄲ、</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㄸ、</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㅃ、</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㅆ、</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㅉ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">；</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㅋ、</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㅌ、</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㅍ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㅊ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㅎ；</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㄴ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㅁ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">、</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㅇ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">；</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㄹ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">”。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">发声部位</p></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13.9999px;\">人类发声器官示意图</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/81618/2022/4/22/642183.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/81618/2022/4/22/642183.png\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/81618/2022/4/23/917491.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/81618/2022/4/23/917491.PNG\"></div>上图是从网上找来的一张韩语子音的发音部位参考图。</div><div><br></div><div>下表是几个子音的表格，括号内是供参考的相近的汉语拼音，但是千万不要把两者等同起来。</div><div><div data-col=\"4\" class=\"selectItem mould-table-wrap auto-size-table\" contenteditable=\"false\" model-id=\"158933\" data-insertcount=\"0\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"table-container\">\n                                  <div class=\"table-overflow\">\n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    <table class=\"mould-table selectItemTable col-group-table\" style=\"width: 295px;\">\n                                      <colgroup><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 79px;\"><col style=\"width: 75px;\"><col style=\"width: 79px;\"></colgroup>\n                                      <tbody>\n                                        \n                                      <tr style=\"height: 47px;\"><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\"></div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">松音\n<div>（平音）</div></div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">紧音\n<div>（硬音）</div></div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">送气音\n<div>（激音）</div></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height:40px;\"><td class=\"\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">双唇</div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ㅂ(b/p)</div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ㅃ(b)</div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ㅍ(p)</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height:40px;\"><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ㅁ(m)</div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\"></div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height:40px;\"><td class=\"\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"3\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">舌尖</div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ㄷ(d/t)</div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ㄸ(d)</div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ㅌ(t)</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height:40px;\"><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ㄴ(n)</div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\"></div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height:40px;\"><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ㄹ(l)</div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\"></div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height:40px;\"><td class=\"\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">舌面</div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ㅈ(z/j)</div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ㅉ(z/j)</div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ㅊ(c/q)</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height:40px;\"><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ㅅ(s/x)</div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ㅆ(s/x)</div></td><td class=\"selected\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height:40px;\"><td class=\"\">\n                    <div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">舌根</div>\n                  </td><td class=\"\">\n                    <div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ㄱ(g/k)</div>\n                  </td><td class=\"\">\n                    <div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ㄲ(g)</div>\n                  </td><td class=\"\">\n                    <div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ㅋ(k)</div>\n                  </td></tr><tr style=\"height:40px;\"><td class=\"\">\n                    <div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">喉咙</div>\n                  </td><td class=\"\">\n                    <div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\"></div>\n                  </td><td class=\"\">\n                    <div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\"></div>\n                  </td><td class=\"\">\n                    <div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\">ㅎ(h)</div>\n                  </td></tr></tbody>\n                                    </table>\n                                  </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div><br><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">名词解释</p></div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">送气音</span>：比如汉语拼音中的“p”。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">汉语拼音中的“b、p”是一对，发音方法基本相同，区别在于“p”比“b”送气多。把手放在嘴前，发出<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">“b”和</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">“</span>p”，会有所感受。</div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">平音（松音）</p></div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">ㄱ</span>：舌根抬起接触软腭，阻挡住气流，然后放开发出此音。听起来像汉语拼音中的“g”和“k”，但在软腭处能感觉到没有汉语拼音“g、k”那么<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">用</span>力。记忆方法：“<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:center;\">ㄱ</span>”像一把枪（<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">g</span>un）。</span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ㄷ</span>：舌尖接触上齿龈<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">，阻挡住气流，然后放开发出此音。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">听起来像汉语拼音中的“d”和“t”，但是送气量<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">和力度比较</span>小。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">记忆方法：“</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㄷ</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">”像杯</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">子倒（<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">d</span>ao）了。</span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">ㅂ</span></span>：双唇闭起来<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">，阻挡住气流，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">然后放开发出此音。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">听起来像汉语拼音中的“b”和“p”，但是送气量和力度比较小。记忆方法：“<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:center;\">ㅂ</span>”像一个杯（<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">b</span>ei）子。</span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">ㅅ</span>：舌面前部接近硬腭，与硬腭之间留一道缝隙，气流通过缝隙发出此音。听起来像汉语拼音中的“s”，但是力度比较小。送气量大时可能会<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">听起来像汉语拼音中的“c”。和高舌位元音（如“<span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅣ、<span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅟ</span></span>”）组合时，舌头要靠后一点点，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">听起来像汉语拼音中的“x”。记忆方法：“<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅅ</span>”像闪（<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">s</span>han）现（<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">x</span>ian）。</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">ㅈ</span>：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">舌面接触硬腭，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">阻挡住气流，</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">然后放出<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">一道缝隙</span>发出此音。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">听起来像汉语拼音中的“z”，但是力度比较小。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">送气量大时<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">可能会</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">听起来像汉语拼音中的“c”。和高舌位元音（如“<span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅣ、<span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅟ</span></span>”）组合时，舌头要靠后一点点，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">听起来像汉语拼音中的“j”。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">记忆方法：“<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅈ</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">”像一个人在玩杂（<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">z</span>a）技（<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">j</span>i）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">注</span>：也有说法说，松音在词首送气，词中不送气。我的理解是，人说话要一口气，开始时气多，后面气就少了，所以不必纠结于词首词中送不送气。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">硬音（紧音）</p></div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">ㄲ</span>：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">发音</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">方法和”<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㄱ</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">“差不多，只是送气量更小，要用力一些，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">听起来像汉语拼音中的“g”。</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">ㄸ</span>：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">发音</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">方法和”<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㄷ</span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">“差不多，只是送气量更小，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">要</span>用力一些，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">听起来像汉语拼音中的“d”。</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">ㅃ</span>：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">发音</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">方法和”<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅂ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">“差不多，只是送气量更小，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">要</span>用力一些，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">听起来像汉语拼音中的“b”。</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">ㅆ</span>：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">发音</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">方法和”<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅅ</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">“差不多，只是送气量更小，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">要</span>用力一些，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">听起来像汉语拼音中的“s”。</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">ㅉ</span>：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">发音</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">方法和”<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅈ</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">“差不多，只是送气量更小，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">要</span>用力一些，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">听起来像汉语拼音中的“z”。</span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">激音（送气音）</p></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">ㅋ</span>：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">比</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">”<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㄱ</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">“多了一笔，</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">发音</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">方法和”<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㄱ</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">“差不多，只是送气量大一些，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">听起来像汉语拼音中的“k”，但是没有那么<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">用</span>力</span>。</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">ㅌ</span>：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">比</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">”<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㄷ</span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">“多了一笔，</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">发音</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">方法和”<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㄷ</span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">“差不多，只是送气量大一些，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">听起来像汉语拼音中的“t”<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">，但是没有那么用力</span></span>。记忆方法：”<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅌ</span>“像英文字母”E“，亚索的E是突（<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">t</span>u）进技能，一E孤行托（<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">t</span>uo）儿索。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\"></span>ㅍ</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">发音</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">方法和”<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅂ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">“差不多，只是送气量大一些，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">听起来像汉语拼音中的“p”<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">，但是没有那么<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">用</span>力</span></span>。记忆方法：”<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅍ”像铁轨可以跑（<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">p</span>ao）火车。</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:24px;\">ㅊ</span>：比</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">”</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">ㅈ“多了一笔，</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">发音</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">方法和”</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">ㅈ“差不多，只是送气量大一些，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">听起来像汉语拼音中的“c”</span>。</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">和高舌位元音（如“</span><span style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;color:rgb(64,64,64);\">ㅣ、ㅟ</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">”）组合时，舌头要靠后一点点，</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;\">听起来像汉语拼音中的“q”。</span><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">ㅎ</span>：气流从喉咙出来，摩擦发出此音。听起来像汉语拼音中的“h”，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">但是没有那么<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">用</span>力</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">。记忆方法：“<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">ㅎ</span>”像一个人戴着帽子（<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">h</span>at）。</span></span></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">鼻音</p></div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">ㄴ</span>：舌尖接触上齿龈，然后用鼻子发音，类似汉语拼音中的“n”。记忆方法：“ㄴ”像“L”，有的地方“n”和“l”不分，“l”其实是“<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">n</span>”。还有，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">“ㄴ”像鼻子（<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">n</span>ose）。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">ㅁ</span>：双唇闭起来，然后用鼻子发音，类似汉语拼音中的“m”。记忆方法：看到方块就会想到<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">M</span>inecraft。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">ㅇ</span>：在一个字中作为首音时不发音，只是起装饰作用。比如“</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 13px;\">아</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">”音同“</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 13px;\">ㅏ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">”。</span><br></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">闪音</p></div><br></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 24px;\">ㄹ</span>：舌尖靠近上齿龈，气流通过时振动舌尖发出此音，不可以卷舌。类似美式英语“water、better”中<span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">有时</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">发成闪音的</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">“t”。与汉语拼音中的“l”有</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">一点点像</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">，但又有</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">区别</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">。记忆方法：“</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">ㄹ</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">”长得像数字2，2就是两（</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; font-weight: bold;\">l</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">iang）。</span></div><div><br></div><div>（<span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">至此，韩语中所有的子音就都学完啦，撒花 x 2</span>）</div></span><div></div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/81618/2022/4/22/642183.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/81618/2022/4/23/917491.PNG"], "model_list": [{"id": 158933, "game_id": 1069, "content_id": 156790, "img": "", "html": "<div data-col=\"4\" class=\"selectItem mould-table-wrap auto-size-table\" contenteditable=\"false\" model-id=\"158933\" data-insertcount=\"0\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"table-container\">\n                                  <div class=\"table-overflow\">\n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    <table class=\"mould-table selectItemTable col-group-table\" style=\"width: 295px;\">\n                                      <colgroup><col style=\"width: 62px;\"><col style=\"width: 79px;\"><col style=\"width: 75px;\"><col style=\"width: 79px;\"></colgroup>\n                                    